Appleseed patch series
======================

Upstream: https://github.com/appleseedhq/appleseed
Base: c4ba82893febd711befb194f905e955d3ee143a3

Patches use diff -Naur format and descriptive filenames. Series.cmake
declares their application order. HISTORY preserves the original
downstream messages and maps them to the available patches.

The bootstrap and boost groups form the CORE compatibility prefix.
They adapt bundled dependencies and toolchains, replace core Boost
facilities with C++17 and PCRE2, and stage modern OSL resources.
Optional Python bindings still require externally supplied Boost.

APPLESEED_PATCH_STAGE=CORE selects the compatibility prefix. The
default ART stage also applies the available rendering enhancements
listed below. ART patches are cumulative and may depend on earlier
topics. Invalid stage names are rejected.

Review topics
-------------

appleseed_dependency_modules.patch: Dependency modules
appleseed_native_build_targets.patch: Native build targets
appleseed_library_api_compatibility.patch: Library api compatibility
appleseed_shader_api_compatibility.patch: Shader api compatibility
appleseed_support_files.patch: Support files
appleseed_platform_and_bundled_libraries.patch: Support bundled libraries and
  platform toolchains
appleseed_core_and_developer_fixes.patch: Harden core helpers and export image
  conversion
appleseed_optional_and_unused_wave.patch: Use standard optional caches and
  drop unused Wave
appleseed_lru_cache_index.patch: Use standard containers for the LRU cache
  index
appleseed_shader_area_index.patch: Use a read-only standard shader
  surface-area index
appleseed_filesystem.patch: Use C++17 filesystem and native file timestamps
appleseed_atomics.patch: Use native atomics and standard renderer counters
appleseed_threads.patch: Use standard locks, threads and condition variables
appleseed_chrono.patch: Use chrono timestamps and remove DateTime adapters
appleseed_denoiser_workers.patch: Remove Bind and synchronize denoiser workers
appleseed_regex_and_build.patch: Use standard helpers and PCRE2 without core
  Boost
appleseed_shader_resources.patch: Stage complete shader resources and
  executable tools
appleseed_procedural_surfaces.patch: Preserve procedural hit data, derivatives
  and ownership
appleseed_osl_input_contracts.patch: Validate OSL inputs and align query
  search policy
appleseed_bump_and_texture_nodes.patch: Preserve bump frames and correct
  texture decoding
appleseed_struetype.patch: Replace vendored font code with bounded struetype
appleseed_ideal_glass.patch: Correct ideal glass and ray differential sampling
appleseed_closure_mixtures.patch: Correct OSL mixtures and plastic material
  sampling
appleseed_coat_closures.patch: Correct coat interfaces and expose the glossy
  layer
appleseed_panorama_and_image_helpers.patch: Correct panorama filtering, depth
  and image helpers
appleseed_cancellation.patch: Honor cancellation during samples and job waits
appleseed_npr_contours.patch: Support orthographic contours through
  translucent covers
appleseed_primary_media.patch: Initialize media and correct glass transport
  scaling
appleseed_boundary_ownership.patch: Resolve coincident optical state before
  shading
appleseed_physical_ray_origins.patch: Preserve physical origins through
  procedural boundaries
appleseed_osl_object_data.patch: Keep trace messages current and expose typed
  object data
appleseed_emitter_surfaces.patch: Preserve sampled emitter attributes,
  transforms and sides
appleseed_emitter_geometry.patch: Preserve hierarchical emitter geometry and
  ray parameters
appleseed_weighted_emitters.patch: Propagate procedural emitter weights and
  densities
appleseed_emitter_mis.patch: Use physical origins and finite guides for
  emitter MIS
appleseed_participating_media.patch: Integrate participating media from
  physical path origins
appleseed_image_output.patch: Keep image channel names and color
  interpretations valid
appleseed_volume_numerics.patch: Stabilize thin-media sampling and panorama
  densities
appleseed_volume_environment.patch: Integrate environment light through hidden
  boundaries
appleseed_directional_emission.patch: Evaluate directional emission in its
  optical context
appleseed_coincident_covers.patch: Resolve real surfaces behind invisible
  covers
appleseed_selected_normal_derivatives.patch: Propagate selected normals
  through specular closures
appleseed_ggx_sampling.patch: Differentiate GGX visible-normal sampled paths
appleseed_surface_frame_derivatives.patch: Differentiate native and OSL
  surface frames
appleseed_beckmann_and_normal_incidence.patch: Stabilize grazing and
  normal-incidence sampling
appleseed_standard_microfacet_reflection.patch: Wire standard OSL microfacet
  reflection and frames
appleseed_closure_ior_context.patch: Resolve closure indices in their adjacent
  media
appleseed_standard_microfacet_transmission.patch: Support standard OSL
  microfacet transmission
